judgeHeader.text:
# L1 judge (protected). Usage, from findings/work/l1: judge/run.sh RUN_ID [--no-cost]
# 1. protected files unchanged (judge/protected.sha256: judge/, snapshot/, L1/Frozen/);
# 2. no forbidden construct in L1/Edit/*.lean;
# 3. compile L1/Frozen (once) and L1/Edit (in import order) against the snapshot of kcore-spec;
# 4. judge/Judge.lean: kernel replay of every editable constant, each target's type is its frozen
#    statement, axioms among propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound;
# 5. cost: k2l-eval (heartbeats per command, one thread, kernel included) on each editable file.
# Writes runs/RUN_ID/{judge.out,cost/,summary.json,meas.jsonl}; exit 0 iff steps 1-4 pass.
